                      <SHORT-NAME>VCOS_OS_CONFIG_FPU_USAGE</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">FPU usage method. NONE means no need to save and restore fpu context during context switch, ALL means all thread will do  save and restore fpu context during context switch, INDIVIDUAL means which thread will need to save and restore fpu context is according to user configuration.</L-2>
                      </DESC>
